{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31044","headline":"秋日将离滑台酬所知二首 一 · 薛能","name":"秋日将离滑台酬所知二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"身起中宵骨亦惊，一分年少已无成。\n松吹竹簟朝眠冷，雨湿蔬飡宿疾生。\n僮汲野泉兼土味，马磨霜树作秋声。\n相知莫话诗心苦，未似前贤取得名。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"薛能","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31044.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31044","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}